Package: kolinos-theme
Architecture: @KOLIN_DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: KolinOS <dev@kolinos.org>
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Depends: bash
Recommends: picom, openbox, tint2, xterm
Description: KolinOS "Corvo Glass" themes
 The Corvo Glass visual identity as installed files: the GTK 2/3 themes
 (/usr/share/themes/CorvoGlass), the openbox theme, the tint2 panel, the rofi
 launcher theme, the terminal colour scheme and the desktop configuration
 under /etc/xdg/kolinos. The wallpapers and logo are shipped by
 kolinos-branding; the compositor (picom) that turns the translucent surfaces
 into real frosted glass is provided by kolinos-desktop.
